{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12705","headline":"登九疑第二峰 · 元结","name":"登九疑第二峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九疑第二峰，其上有仙坛。\n杉松映飞泉，苍苍在云端。\n何人居此处，云是鲁女冠。\n不知几百岁，燕坐饵金丹。\n相传羽化时，云鹤满峰峦。\n妇中有高人，相望空长叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}